fin-strategy:StrategyExecutionPackage a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "Strategy Execution Package, is a versioned specification that binds one exact strategy version to its executable implementation, factor-dependency closure, and input contract, used for ensuring a backtest runs the strategy it declares and that the code, factor dependencies, and input contract are mutually consistent.";
